  "title": "Peekremote V0 enhancements to indicate band",
  "description": "Define 2 reserved fields in PeekremoteV0.flags field to carry band\ninformation, and compute frequency based on <band, channel number>. This\nensures that correct frequency is refelcted in 802.11 radio information,\nas well as facilitates decoding of MCS_NSS field in EHT Capabilities IE.\n\nCloses #19792.",
