        {
          "id": 1875474717,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "- 6GHZ_BAND_VALID : This bit indicates whether the next bit \"IS_6GHZ\" carries band information or not.\n\nPerhaps it should be renamed to \"6GHZ_BAND_KNOWN\", for clarity?\n\nIf this extra bit is not defined, and only the \"IS_6GHZ\" bit is added via this commit, then 6GHz PeekremoteV0 frames from sniffer devices that do not support the field yet, will wrongly be identified as 2.4GHz/5GHz.\n\n\n- IS_6GHZ : indicates whether the operating band is 6GHz.",
          "author": {
            "id": 19290085,
            "username": "kripa-v",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "kripa",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/847c0b806932820efa82df4bfc1ca486f96094d05dd504522303ac8ccafd02f0?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/kripa-v"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-04-22T17:03:38.415Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-04-23T21:53:47.807Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 297375200,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
